5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I believe we should look at who is available to help us. I'll check the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'm interested in the logistics. I will look into the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I want to know what the people actually think. I'll take the visitor comment slips and the weekend head counts.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The building's limits are my priority. I'll check the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to see where the money goes! I'll check the loan transport costs and the mount-making charges.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
