49,3,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
50,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"The candidates are Textiles, City Excavation, Light and Motion, and Maritime Trade. I think Textiles fits our volunteers perfectly.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Shion,,Maritime Trade involves too many loans. Light and Motion is a maintenance nightmare. City Excavation has a conservation bench.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,May,,"City Excavation has that working bench! That satisfies the ""human presence"" the visitors love. Textiles has demonstrations too.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Excavation finds can be heavy. Light and Motion needs rigging. Textiles seems the safest for the floor and the hire bookings.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Sakura,,Textiles has demonstration sessions! That sounds like fun and probably doesn't cost as much as shipping huge ships.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, the conservation bench in the City exhibition might be too much for our one remaining staff member to manage.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue is right. The lab is already backlogged. A ""working bench"" is just more work for a tired person.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,May,,"I see. In that case, the demonstration sessions in the Textiles exhibition provide the same appeal without the lab stress.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"Textiles also uses local weaving, which means fewer expensive loan transports and less risk with shipping cut-offs.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"I love the Textiles idea! It's local, it's colorful, and it won't break the bank or the floor.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Shizue,,It seems we are in agreement. It supports our volunteers and respects our staff's limits.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Shion,,It is the most logical choice to avoid the pitfalls of the previous seasons.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,May,,I'm sold. It gives the visitors the interaction they crave.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Misaki,,It is the most compatible with the building's physical and scheduling constraints.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Sakura,,Yay! Let's go with the weaving and dyeing!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
